apple.svg, google.svg, joplin.svg and simplenote.svg are from Simple Icons 16.33.0 (https://simpleicons.org),
released under CC0-1.0. The logos are trademarks of their owners; they are used
only to label the "Apple Calendar (iCloud)" and "Google Calendar" options and
the Joplin and Simplenote note sources.

betternotes.svg is the application icon of BetterNotes
(https://github.com/thebanri/BetterNotes), released under the MIT licence; it
is only used to label that note source.

calculator-symbolic.svg was drawn for this widget (GPL-2.0-or-later): the
Calculator button of the Controls page needs a single-colour icon and the
Breeze one is partly transparent.
